    "self-hosted"
  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The foundational WSI file I/O library — used invisibly by QuPath, HistomicsTK, and virtually every computational pathology pipeline to read proprietary scanner formats. LGPL-2.1, v4.0.0 (October 2023), 11 vendor formats supported, CMU/NIH origin. Like ITK in the radiology space, OpenSlide is infrastructure that operates below the surface of higher-level tools rather than being used directly by end users.",
